OL,3,AFirst ministers of Wales, Scotland and
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,7,Fand Northern Ireland have begun meeting
OL,8,Fin Cardiff to discuss "working more
OL,9,Fclosely" including on constitutional
OL,10,Fissues.
OL,12,FIt is the first face-to-face meeting
OL,13,Famong the nationalist leaders since
OL,14,FPlaid Cymru's Rhun ap Iorwerth was
OL,15,Felected in May, with all three wanting
OL,16,Ftheir countries to leave the United
OL,17,FKingdom.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
